    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Josiya waamuru kukala Pasaka ishereekewe himo Jerusalemu kumuishimu Mwenyezi Mlungu. Ndipho mwana ngʼondzi wa Pasaka achitsindzwa siku ya kumi na ne ya mwezi wa kpwandza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku iyo Josiya waaikira alavyadzi-sadaka mazuma gao ga kuhumika kpwenye nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waiha phamwenga Alawi ambao nkufundza shariya na ni atakatifu mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu achiaambira, “Hiro sanduku takatifu riinjizeni ndani ya nyumba yodzengbwa ni Selemani mwana wa Daudi, mfalume wa Iziraeli. Tamlondwa kuritsukula tsona mwenu mafuzini. Muhumikireni Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu na atue himo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.8.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Nyakati 8:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kalani tayari kuhenda kazi yopangirwa ni Daudi, mfalume wa Iziraeli na mwanawe Selemani sawa-sawa na mazuma ga mbari zenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha imani phatu phatakatifu phamwenga na Alawi a chila kundi ra mbari zenu, ili muweze kuterya chila nyumba ya atu a Iziraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dzitakaseni ili atu anaphokureherani ana ngʼondzi na ana mbuzi a Pasaka, muatsindze na muatayarishe akale sadaka kpwa Mwenyezi Mlungu. Hakikishani kukala atu akasherekeya kulengana na neno ra Mwenyezi Mlungu rolaviwa ni Musa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha Josiya achialavira hinyo atu ambao kala akedza, ana ngʼondzi na ana mbuzi elufu mirongo mihahu na ndzau elufu tahu kpwa ajili ya sadaka ya Pasaka, kula kpwa mali za mfalume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na maofisaa a mfalume nao achilavya kpwa hiyari mtsango wao wa nyama a sadaka kpwa ajili ya atu na kpwa ajili ya alavyadzi-sadaka na kpwa ajili ya Alawi. Alavyadzi-sadaka ahewa ni Hilikiya na Zakariya na Jehieli ambao ni aimirizi akulu a Nyumba ya kuvoya Mlungu, ana ngʼondzi na ana mbuzi elufu mbiri na magana sita na ndzau magana mahahu akale sadaka za sharee ya Pasaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Konaniya na anáo airi, Shemaya na Nethaneli, phamwenga na Hashabia, Jeieli na Jozabadi, ambao kala ni akulu a Alawi, piya aapha alavyadzi-sadaka ana ngʼondzi na ana mbuzi elufu tsano na ndzau magana matsano alaviwe kama sadaka ya pasaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati chila chitu chiriphokala tayari kpwa ajili ya sharee za Pasaka, alavyadzi-sadaka na Alawi aima phatu aripholagizwa ni mfalume Josiya, kulengana na mazuma gao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha Alawi atsindza na achiyula ana ngʼondzi a Pasaka na milatso achiapha alavyadzi-sadaka nao achiitimvya-timvya phatu pha kulavira sadaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinyo Alawi atenga sadaka za kuochwa na achiaganyira atu kulengana na mbari zao, ili amlavire Mwenyezi Mlungu dza irivyolagizwa kpwenye chitabu cha Musa. Na hizo ndzau nazo piya zahendwa dza vivyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.12.8+EXO.12.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kutsama 12:8–9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao ana ngʼondzi a Pasaka aochwa sawa-sawa na irivyolagizwa na sadaka zanjina takatifu zatseruswa na nyungu, zanjina masufuriani, zanjina kalangoni, achihenda wangbwi wa kuaphirikira atu arye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku yosi alavyadzi-sadaka ambao kala ni a chivyazi cha Aruni ashuulika kulavya sadaka za kuochwa na kuocha mafuha ga nyama hipho dzulu ya phatu pha kulavira sadaka. Iriphokala chila mmwenga akamala, ndipho hinyo Alawi achitayarisha nyama zao a Pasaka kpwa ajili yao enye na alavyadzi-sadaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
