        },
        {
          "text": "Bada ya mfalume Josiya kumala kuitengeza Nyumba ya kuvoya Mlungu, mfalume Neko wa Misiri, walongoza jeshire kula Misiri ili edze apigane hiko Karikemishi phephi na muho Yufurati. Naye Josiya waambuka kpwendapigana naye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela mfalume Neko wahuma ajumbe kpwa Josiya kumuambira, “Mino sina viha na uwe, mfalume wa Juda! Sikedza pigana na uwe, ela na nyumba nriyona viha nayo. Naye Mlungu akaniamuru nihende upesi. Phahi richa kumpinga Mlungu ariye phamwenga nami asedze akakubananga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
